        <mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;" value="Go · two engines. Brand Engine = tenant identity · live? · Store Engine = store · group · hours · zone. Azure AD login and store-manager role live in Identity. Admin BFF is the only write door. No store portal. No Store BFF. brand_id on every hop. Shared topics, not per-brand stacks." vertex="1">
