        <mxCell id="p-who-s" parent="p-who" style="text;fontFamily=Arial;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;" value="Store info is managed by an admin who already has store-manager, or a grant that can manage store. They sign in with Azure AD and use Admin BFF. A missing role or grant stops here. No store portal. No Store BFF." vertex="1">
